     },
     "said": [
      "2009), eight sampling units of each drove road were randomly located in environments with herbaceous crops, while the other eight sampling units were located in environments with vineyards.",
      "The used drove road also had a positive edge effect on ant species diversity in adjacent croplands (both herbaceous crops and vineyards)."
     ],
     "value": "measured"
    },
    "Herbaceous Crop": {
     "choice": "measured",
     "probs": {
      "measured": 0.969,
      "literature": 0.031
     },
     "said": [
      "## Results ## Ant species richness Six sampling units (one in the vineyard CDR, three in the herbaceous crop CDR, one in the herbaceous crop MDR, and one in the vineyard MDR) were eliminated, because of some pitfall traps being lost or damaged."
     ],
     "value": "measured"
