     },
     "said": [
      "We followed the classification by Roig and Espadaler (2010), who delineated eight functional groups: invasive and/ or exotic (IE), generalists and/or opportunistic (GO), social parasites (P), specialist pre-dators (SP), coarse woody debris specialists (CWDS), cold-climate specialists and/or shade habitats (CCS/SH), hot climate specialists and/or open habitats (HCS/OH), and cryptic (C).",
